{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 4, "text": "考古发现，布依族先民早在旧石器时代已学会用火和人工取火技术。布依族古歌", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 394, "w": 1463, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "考古发现，布依族先民早在旧石器时代已学会用火和人工取火技术。布依族古歌", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 394, "w": 1463, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 5, "text": "《造万物》中有这样一节：", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 459, "w": 438, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "《造万物》中有这样一节：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 459, "w": 438, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 6, "text": "“我们拣石块/用石块来磨/用石块来碰/用石块来搓”。“只要磨久了/一定会出火/", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 515, "w": 1471, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“我们拣石块/用石块来磨/用石块来碰/用石块来搓”。“只要磨久了/一定会出火/", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 515, "w": 1471, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 7, "text": "只要碰着实/一定会出火/只要用力搓/一定会出火”。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 583, "w": 925, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "只要碰着实/一定会出火/只要用力搓/一定会出火”。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 583, "w": 925, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 8, "text": "这是造千种万物的布依族祖先勒灵对众人讲的话。古歌接着叙述众人照勒灵说的", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 648, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这是造千种万物的布依族祖先勒灵对众人讲的话。古歌接着叙述众人照勒灵说的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 648, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 9, "text": "话去做，果然有了火。这是布依族先民在创造石器过程中总结出人工取火技术的生动写", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 712, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "话去做，果然有了火。这是布依族先民在创造石器过程中总结出人工取火技术的生动写", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 712, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 10, "text": "照。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 781, "w": 64, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "照。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 781, "w": 64, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 11, "text": "火的使用，对当时人们的生活是一种进步和变革。从那时起，人们便不再吃生肉，用", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 841, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "火的使用，对当时人们的生活是一种进步和变革。从那时起，人们便不再吃生肉，用", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 841, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 12, "text": "火来烧烤，这样熟食便于吸收营养和消化，增强体质，减少疾病，促进大脑的发达；用火御", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 905, "w": 1544, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "火来烧烤，这样熟食便于吸收营养和消化，增强体质，减少疾病，促进大脑的发达；用火御", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 905, "w": 1544, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 13, "text": "寒，有利于长期生活在潮湿多变的温带，用火防御武器，抵制猛兽的侵袭；用火照明，改", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 974, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "寒，有利于长期生活在潮湿多变的温带，用火防御武器，抵制猛兽的侵袭；用火照明，改", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 974, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 14, "text": "造了人们的生活条件。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1034, "w": 394, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "造了人们的生活条件。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1034, "w": 394, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 15, "text": "（二）弓箭的制作", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1106, "w": 306, "h": 41}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（二）弓箭的制作", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1106, "w": 306, "h": 41}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 16, "text": "布依族神话古歌中，提到弓箭的地方不少。而最著名的莫过于射日的神话和古歌。", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1163, "w": 1471, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族神话古歌中，提到弓箭的地方不少。而最著名的莫过于射日的神话和古歌。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1163, "w": 1471, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 17, "text": "布依族摩经中也有射日神话。尽管在人物名称及情节方面各有些差异，但使用的均为弓", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1227, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族摩经中也有射日神话。尽管在人物名称及情节方面各有些差异，但使用的均为弓", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1227, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 18, "text": "箭。这说明弓箭曾是布依族先民普遍使用的武器。布依族弓箭的产生时间，按古歌《造", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1291, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "箭。这说明弓箭曾是布依族先民普遍使用的武器。布依族弓箭的产生时间，按古歌《造", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1291, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 19, "text": "万物》说法，是在掌握人工取火之前。其实，人工取火在旧石器时代已有，而弓箭则是在", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1360, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "万物》说法，是在掌握人工取火之前。其实，人工取火在旧石器时代已有，而弓箭则是在", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1360, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 20, "text": "旧石器时代向新石器时代过渡期的中石器时代的后期才生产的。弓和箭的构造很复杂，", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1428, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "旧石器时代向新石器时代过渡期的中石器时代的后期才生产的。弓和箭的构造很复杂，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1428, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 21, "text": "没有长久的生产经验和技巧的积累是不可能发明的。因为这需要使人的体力和树枝的", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1493, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "没有长久的生产经验和技巧的积累是不可能发明的。因为这需要使人的体力和树枝的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1493, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 22, "text": "弯曲的弹力结合在一起。因此，布依族先民发明弓箭在当时是一种技术进步的表现。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1557, "w": 1471, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "弯曲的弹力结合在一起。因此，布依族先民发明弓箭在当时是一种技术进步的表现。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1557, "w": 1471, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 23, "text": "（三）房屋建筑技术", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1621, "w": 350, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（三）房屋建筑技术", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1621, "w": 350, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 24, "text": "布依族自古以来，多选择溪河两岸，坝子旁边居住。由于低地潮湿，故民居均为“干", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1682, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族自古以来，多选择溪河两岸，坝子旁边居住。由于低地潮湿，故民居均为“干", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1682, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 25, "text": "栏”式建筑。考古发掘出的战国至西汉年间今黔西南布依族苗族自治州安龙县铜鼓山遗", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1742, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "栏”式建筑。考古发掘出的战国至西汉年间今黔西南布依族苗族自治州安龙县铜鼓山遗", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1742, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 26, "text": "址有“房屋柱洞、灶、路面”及“青铜钺”等文物，说明布依族先民古越人当时居住“干栏”", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1806, "w": 1548, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "址有“房屋柱洞、灶、路面”及“青铜钺”等文物，说明布依族先民古越人当时居住“干栏”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1806, "w": 1548, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 27, "text": "式建筑，并可能形成了特定的起居习俗。这种居室距离地面一定高度，利于防潮防虫蛇，", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1875, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "式建筑，并可能形成了特定的起居习俗。这种居室距离地面一定高度，利于防潮防虫蛇，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1875, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 28, "text": "适应南方气候炎热、雨量充沛的自然条件，人居其上，畜养其下，十分安全。加之竹木内", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1939, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "适应南方气候炎热、雨量充沛的自然条件，人居其上，畜养其下，十分安全。加之竹木内", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1939, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 29, "text": "墙，通风舒适。现代，布依族地区还不同程度地保留有干栏建筑的特点，且发展变化出多", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2004, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "墙，通风舒适。现代，布依族地区还不同程度地保留有干栏建筑的特点，且发展变化出多", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2004, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 30, "text": "种形式，如“吊脚楼”、“石板房”、“平房”，等等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2068, "w": 824, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "种形式，如“吊脚楼”、“石板房”、“平房”，等等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2068, "w": 824, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 31, "text": "干栏式住宅建筑，是布依族传统建筑形式。《北史•南僚传》说：布依族先民僚人“依", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 2132, "w": 1463, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "干栏式住宅建筑，是布依族传统建筑形式。《北史•南僚传》说：布依族先民僚人“依", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 2132, "w": 1463, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 332, "line_no": 32, "text": "树积木，以居其上，名日干栏”。当时的干栏房多为竹、木结构，底层空敞，人居其上。至", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2197, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "树积木，以居其上，名日干栏”。当时的干栏房多为竹、木结构，底层空敞，人居其上。至", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2197, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
